    standing: MigrationStartedHere { what: "card_cooling_route reports now take a RouteSubject built from duct_card_dims (route_subject_of), so card-dependent outputs derive from the selected card and route_report_for refuses an unread card by naming its reading, never substituting the A16 (this change)" },
